{
  "info": {
    "name": "Strapi 5 — ćwiczenie P3 (REST API)",
    "description": "Zapytania z ćwiczenia P3 (`exercises/podstawy/03-rest-api.md`). Zmienne kolekcji: `baseUrl`, `documentId` (ustawiana automatycznie), `authorName`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Endpointy",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lista artykułów",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const first = pm.response.json().data?.[0];",
                  "if (first) pm.collectionVariables.set('documentId', first.documentId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pierwsze wywołanie zwraca 403 — Strapi domyślnie blokuje wszystko.\nPo włączeniu `find` i `findOne` dla roli Public (krok 2) zwraca listę.\nZapisuje `documentId` pierwszego artykułu do zmiennej `documentId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Jeden artykuł (documentId)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{documentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles",
                "{{documentId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Do pojedynczego wpisu odwołujemy się przez `documentId`, nie numeryczne `id`.\nZmienną ustawia zapytanie „Lista artykułów”."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Utworzenie (403 dla Public)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rola Public nie ma uprawnienia `create` — oczekiwany wynik to 403. Zapis z tokenem: ćwiczenie P4.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"title\": \"Artykuł z API\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Aktualizacja (403 dla Public)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{documentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles",
                "{{documentId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Oczekiwany wynik: 403.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"title\": \"Zmieniony tytuł\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Usunięcie (403 dla Public)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{documentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles",
                "{{documentId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Oczekiwany wynik: 403."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. populate",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "populate=author",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles?populate=author",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "populate",
                  "value": "author"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Dołącza relację `author` — bez `populate` pola `author` nie ma w odpowiedzi."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "populate zagnieżdżone (avatar autora)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles?populate[author][populate]=avatar",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "populate[author][populate]",
                  "value": "avatar"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Autor razem z jego avatarem."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "populate=* (wszystkie relacje)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles?populate=*",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "populate",
                  "value": "*"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Wszystkie relacje pierwszego poziomu."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. filters",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Tytuł zawiera „internet”",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles?filters[title][$containsi]=internet",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "filters[title][$containsi]",
                  "value": "internet"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`$containsi` — bez rozróżniania wielkości liter.\nOperatory: `$eq`, `$ne`, `$contains`, `$containsi`, `$gt`, `$gte`, `$lt`, `$lte`, `$in`, `$null`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Opublikowane od 2026-01-01",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles?filters[publishedAt][$gte]=2026-01-01",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "filters[publishedAt][$gte]",
                  "value": "2026-01-01"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filtrowanie po dacie."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Zadanie — artykuły autora",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles?filters[author][name][$eq]={{authorName}}&populate=author",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "articles"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "filters[author][name][$eq]",
                  "value": "{{authorName}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "populate",
                  "value": "author"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filtr po polu relacji. Zmienna `authorName` ma domyślnie „David Doe” (autor z danych przykładowych) — zapytanie zwraca 2 artykuły."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
